  m_text: 'Tracheoesophageal Fistula


    A TEF is an abnormal connection between
    your esophagus and trachea. TEF may also be acquired in adulthood due to cancer,
    infection or trauma. The leakage of the blue dye was seen from the right main
    bronchus.'
