    left and right.

    Use the W and S Keys to move the camera forward and backword.


    2.
    Lesions Selection & Details

    Click to highlight a Lesion. Please select only
    one abnormal change to proceed.


    [Space] key down: Enter the "lesion details"
    view for the selected lesion.


    [Escape] key down: Exit the "leison details"
    view.'
